# /home/opc/.config/systemd/user/devforge-watchdog-failed.service
# OnFailure handler: watchdog이 재시작 한계를 넘겨 failed 상태가 되면 알림.
[Unit]
Description=DevForge Watchdog failed-state alert (OnFailure)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
Environment=PYTHONPATH=/opt/projects/server/scripts
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3.12 /opt/projects/server/scripts/watchdog.py --notify-failure
StandardOutput=journal
StandardError=journal
